{"id":1271,"date":"2025-09-09T19:40:38","date_gmt":"2025-09-09T17:40:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/elementor-1256\/"},"modified":"2026-07-02T13:21:35","modified_gmt":"2026-07-02T11:21:35","slug":"menorca-en-septiembre","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/menorca-en-septiembre\/","title":{"rendered":"Menorca al setembre"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1271\" class=\"elementor elementor-1271 elementor-1256\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0140b63 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0140b63\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed091be elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ed091be\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<article class=\"vm-post vm-post--biosfera\" lang=\"es\">\n  \n  <header class=\"vm-header\">\n    <h1>Menorca al setembre: 15 plans tranquils i consells de guia local<\/h1>\n    <p class=\"vm-deck\">Menys gent, llum suau i aigua perfecta per banyar-se. Idees reals per gaudir l&#8217;illa i enlla\u00e7ar amb les nostres visites guiades per <strong>Ciutadella<\/strong> i <strong>Ma\u00f3<\/strong>. <\/p>\n    <div class=\"vm-header-cta\">\n      <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--whatsapp\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\ud83d\udcac Consultar horaris i reservar<\/a>\n      <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--outline\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/excursiones\/\">\ud83d\udd0e Veure totes les excursions<\/a>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/header>\n\n  \n  <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/6007140\/pexels-photo-6007140.jpeg?resize=800%2C450&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Menorca al setembre: capvespre al far de Fav\u00e0ritx\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\">\n    <figcaption>Far de Fav\u00e0ritx \u2022 Foto: Pexels<\/figcaption>\n  <\/figure>\n\n  \n  <nav class=\"vm-toc\" aria-label=\"Contenido\">\n    <strong>Contingut<\/strong>\n    <ol>\n      <li><a href=\"#por-que-septiembre\">Qu\u00e8 fa especial el setembre<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#calas\">Top 5 cales amb menys aflu\u00e8ncia<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#atardeceres\">Capvespres imprescindibles<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#ciutadella\">Ciutadella al capvespre (amb tour)<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#mahon\">Ma\u00f3 al mat\u00ed (amb tour)<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#cami\">Cam\u00ed de Cavalls: 3 trams f\u00e0cils<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#talayot\">Talai\u00f2tic per a principiants<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#comer\">Menjar b\u00e9 sense cues<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#transporte\">Transport i aparcament<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#mochila\">Qu\u00e8 portar a la motxilla<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#mapa\">Mapa amb els 15 plans<\/a><\/li>\n      <li><a href=\"#faq\">Preguntes freq\u00fcents<\/a><\/li>\n    <\/ol>\n  <\/nav>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"por-que-septiembre\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>1) Qu\u00e8 fa especial el setembre<\/h2>\n    <p>L&#8217;illa respira despr\u00e9s del pic d&#8217;agost: m\u00e9s disponibilitat, menys tr\u00e0nsit i mar temperat. La llum de tarda \u00e9s perfecta per a fotos a cales i cascos hist\u00f2rics. <\/p>\n    <p class=\"vm-inline-links\">\u2192 Apr\u00e8n per qu\u00e8 Menorca \u00e9s <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/reserva-biosfera-menorca\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reserva de la Biosfera<\/a>.<\/p>\n    <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/29104816\/pexels-photo-29104816.jpeg?resize=800%2C534&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Carrer amb arquitectura tradicional a Ciutadella de Menorca al capvespre\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\">\n      <figcaption>Ciutadella al capvespre \u2022 Foto: Pexels<\/figcaption>\n    <\/figure>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"calas\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>2) Top 5 cales amb menys aflu\u00e8ncia<\/h2>\n    <p>Matineja una mica i tindr\u00e0s escenari gaireb\u00e9 privat. Cinc opcions equilibrades entre bellesa i acc\u00e9s: <\/p>\n    <div class=\"vm-gallery\">\n      <figure>\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/13717494\/pexels-photo-13717494.jpeg?resize=800%2C533&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Cala Galdana des del mirador amb pins, Menorca\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\">\n        <figcaption>Cala Galdana<\/figcaption>\n      <\/figure>\n      <figure>\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/32218229\/pexels-photo-32218229.jpeg?resize=800%2C533&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Cala Pilar a la costa nord de Menorca\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\">\n        <figcaption>Cala Pilar<\/figcaption>\n      <\/figure>\n      <figure>\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/9510812\/pexels-photo-9510812.jpeg?resize=800%2C533&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Penya-segats i mar a la costa de Ciutadella de Menorca\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\">\n        <figcaption>Costa de Ciutadella<\/figcaption>\n      <\/figure>\n    <\/div>\n    <ul class=\"vm-list\">\n      <li><strong>Algaiarens (La Vall):<\/strong> f\u00e0cil acc\u00e9s i tons verds intensos.<\/li>\n      <li><strong>Cavalleria:<\/strong> sorra vermellosa, far proper per al capvespre.<\/li>\n      <li><strong>Cala Pilar:<\/strong> salvatge; ideal amb lleu tramuntana.<\/li>\n      <li><strong>Binigaus:<\/strong> ampli arenal per passejar al final del dia.<\/li>\n      <li><strong>Es Grau:<\/strong> familiar i amb enlla\u00e7 al <em>Cam\u00ed de Cavalls<\/em>.<\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n    <p class=\"vm-inline-links\">\u2192 Guia pr\u00e0ctica: <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/las-mejores-playas-de-menorca-y-cuales-evitar-en-temporada-alta\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Millors platges de Menorca i quines evitar<\/a>.<\/p>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"atardeceres\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>3) Capvespres imprescindibles<\/h2>\n    <ol class=\"vm-steps\">\n      <li><strong>Pont d&#8217;en Gil<\/strong> (Ciutadella): arc natural fotog\u00e8nic.<\/li>\n      <li><strong>Far de Cavalleria<\/strong>: horitz\u00f3 net i costa nord.<\/li>\n      <li><strong>Far d&#8217;Artrutx<\/strong>: silueta ic\u00f2nica amb restaurants.<\/li>\n    <\/ol>\n    <p class=\"vm-inline-links\">\u2192 Completa la teva ruta: <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/guia-faros-menorca\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Els 7 fars de Menorca<\/a>.<\/p>\n    <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/16565376\/pexels-photo-16565376.jpeg?resize=800%2C450&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Far de Cavalleria amb cel net al capvespre, Menorca\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\">\n      <figcaption>Far de Cavalleria \u2022 Foto: Pexels<\/figcaption>\n    <\/figure>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"ciutadella\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>4) Ciutadella al capvespre: casc hist\u00f2ric i racons fotog\u00e8nics<\/h2>\n    <p>La nostra <strong>visita guiada per Ciutadella<\/strong> recorre Pla\u00e7a des Born, Catedral, carrerons de mar\u00e8s i miradors al port. Consells de foto i parades \u201csecretes\u201d. <\/p>\n    <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/32849451\/pexels-photo-32849451.jpeg?resize=800%2C534&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Riba rocosa i aig\u00fces turqueses a Ciutadella de Menorca\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\">\n      <figcaption>Riba a Ciutadella \u2022 Foto: Pexels<\/figcaption>\n    <\/figure>\n    <p class=\"vm-cta-inline\">\n      <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--primary\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/excursiones\/\">\ud83d\udd14 Reservar visita a Ciutadella<\/a>\n      <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--outline\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\ud83d\udcac Preguntar per WhatsApp<\/a>\n    <\/p>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"mahon\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>5) Ma\u00f3 al mat\u00ed: port, miradors i mercat<\/h2>\n    <p>El <strong>port de Ma\u00f3<\/strong> llueix amb la llum de primeres hores. Al tour visitem miradors, el mercat i carrers amb hist\u00f2ries de corsaris i comerciants. <\/p>\n    <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/17422240\/pexels-photo-17422240.jpeg?resize=800%2C534&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Vista de port mediterrani amb embarcacions, Menorca\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\">\n      <figcaption>Port (referencial) \u2022 Foto: Pexels<\/figcaption>\n    <\/figure>\n    <p class=\"vm-cta-inline\">\n      <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--primary\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/excursiones\/\">\ud83e\udded Reservar visita a Ma\u00f3<\/a>\n      <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--outline\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/excursiones\/\">\ud83d\udd0e Veure totes les excursions<\/a>\n    <\/p>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"cami\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>6) Cam\u00ed de Cavalls: 3 trams f\u00e0cils per a mig dia<\/h2>\n    <ul class=\"vm-cards\">\n      <li>\n        <h3>Es Grau \u2192 Far de Fav\u00e0ritx (parcial)<\/h3>\n        <p>3\u20136 km (adaptable). Passarel\u00b7les i aiguamolls; ideal amb nens. <\/p>\n      <\/li>\n      <li>\n        <h3>Algaiarens \u2192 Cala Pilar (parcial)<\/h3>\n        <p>6\u20138 km. Bosc, dunes i miradors. Porta aigua.  <\/p>\n      <\/li>\n      <li>\n        <h3>Son Saura \u2192 Cala en Turqueta<\/h3>\n        <p>5\u20137 km. Costa sud, ombra intermitent i cales turquesa. <\/p>\n      <\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n    <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/32207396\/pexels-photo-32207396.jpeg?resize=800%2C534&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Senyal de fusta cap a Cal\u00f3 Fondo a la costa de Ciutadella\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\">\n      <figcaption>Senyal en sender costaner \u2022 Foto: Pexels<\/figcaption>\n    <\/figure>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"talayot\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>7) Talai\u00f2tic per a principiants<\/h2>\n    <p>Per comen\u00e7ar, combina <strong>Naveta des Tudons<\/strong> amb un poblat talai\u00f2tic (Torralba d&#8217;en Salort o Talat\u00ed de Dalt). En 2\u20133 hores entendr\u00e0s taules, talaiot i navetes. <\/p>\n    <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Naveta%20des%20Tudons%20-%20001.jpg\" alt=\"Naveta des Tudons a Ciutadella, Menorca\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\">\n      <figcaption>Naveta des Tudons \u2022 Foto: Wikimedia Commons (CC BY-SA)<\/figcaption>\n    <\/figure>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"comer\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>8) Menjar b\u00e9 sense cues<\/h2>\n    <ul class=\"vm-list\">\n      <li>Reserva taula per a les 13:00\u201313:30 o 20:00\u201320:30.<\/li>\n      <li>Pregunta per plats locals: caldereta, oliaigua, formatge Ma\u00f3-Menorca DOP.<\/li>\n      <li>Als pobles petits, confirma horaris fora de cap de setmana.<\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n    <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/images.pexels.com\/photos\/33484279\/pexels-photo-33484279.jpeg?resize=800%2C534&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Guisat de marisc fumejant en olla negra (referencial)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\">\n      <figcaption>Guisat de marisc (referencial) \u2022 Foto: Pexels<\/figcaption>\n    <\/figure>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"transporte\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>9) Transport i aparcament al setembre<\/h2>\n    <p>L&#8217;autob\u00fas funciona b\u00e9 cap a nuclis principals; per a cales m\u00e9s remotes, cotxe o taxi. Arriba d&#8217;hora als aparcaments de platges del sud si el dia est\u00e0 molt estable. <\/p>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"mochila\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>10) Qu\u00e8 portar a la motxilla<\/h2>\n    <ul class=\"vm-checklist\">\n      <li>Aigua (1\u20131,5 L per persona) i alguna cosa salada.<\/li>\n      <li>Gorra, ulleres i protector solar.<\/li>\n      <li>Cal\u00e7at tancat per al sender i xancletes per a la cala.<\/li>\n      <li>Tovallola lleugera i bossa per a residus.<\/li>\n      <li>Frontal\/llanterna si tornes despr\u00e9s del capvespre.<\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"mapa\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>11) Mapa amb els 15 plans<\/h2>\n    <p>Hem marcat cales, fars, miradors i punts dels nostres tours. Fes-lo servir per organitzar els teus dies. <\/p>\n    \n    <div class=\"vm-mapwrap\">\n      <iframe src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps\/d\/embed?mid=16AJzsa_43Jks1nhu9DG2gXcWBDFDCv8&amp;ehbc=2E312F\" width=\"100%\" height=\"480\" style=\"border:0\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"><\/iframe>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"vm-section\">\n    <h2>12) Preguntes freq\u00fcents<\/h2>\n    <details class=\"vm-faq\">\n      <summary>Fa calor al setembre a Menorca?<\/summary>\n      <p>Durant la primera meitat del mes sol fer calor suau i nits m\u00e9s fresques. Porta capa lleugera per al capvespre. <\/p>\n    <\/details>\n    <details class=\"vm-faq\">\n      <summary>Es pot continuar banyant-se?<\/summary>\n      <p>S\u00ed, la temperatura del mar acostuma a ser excel\u00b7lent al setembre, ideal per a sessions llargues sense sensaci\u00f3 de fred.<\/p>\n    <\/details>\n    <details class=\"vm-faq\">\n      <summary>Quins trams del Cam\u00ed de Cavalls s\u00f3n m\u00e9s f\u00e0cils?<\/summary>\n      <p>Es Grau\u2013Fav\u00e0ritx (parcial), Son Saura\u2013Cala en Turqueta i entorn d&#8217;Algaiarens combinen bon ferm i paisatges.<\/p>\n    <\/details>\n    <details class=\"vm-faq\">\n      <summary>Com moure&#8217;m sense cotxe?<\/summary>\n      <p>Fes servir autob\u00fas entre nuclis i combina amb taxi per a cales. Per con\u00e8ixer ciutat, reserva les nostres <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/excursiones\/\">visites guiades<\/a>. <\/p>\n    <\/details>\n    <details class=\"vm-faq\">\n      <summary>Necessito reservar restaurants?<\/summary>\n      <p>Recomanat, especialment caps de setmana. Entre setmana, a primera hora de servei sol haver-hi disponibilitat. <\/p>\n    <\/details>\n  <\/section>\n\n  \n  <p class=\"vm-cta-inline vm-cta-inline--final\">\n    <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--whatsapp\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\ud83d\udcac Parlar per WhatsApp<\/a>\n    <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--outline\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/excursiones\/\">\ud83d\udd0e Veure excursions<\/a>\n    <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--outline\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/guia-faros-menorca\/\">\ud83c\udf05 Fars de Menorca<\/a>\n    <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--outline\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/las-mejores-playas-de-menorca-y-cuales-evitar-en-temporada-alta\/\">\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Millors platges<\/a>\n  <\/p>\n<\/article>\n\n\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --vm-ink:#0b1220; --vm-muted:#5b667a; --vm-bg:#fff